.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
READMEcopy.md

# Private working notes (planning drafts) — not part of the shipped project
# Screenshots are not published. The previous set was captured before the UI was
# cleaned of fabricated social proof, so the committed landing-page image still
# advertised "4.8/5 by 2,400+ users" and six invented customer logos that the app
# no longer renders. Rather than ship stale marketing imagery, the README documents
# behaviour in text and the eval reports carry the evidence.
# If screenshots are re-added later they must be captured AFTER a UI change, not before.
# screenshots/

# Local editor / assistant tooling
.claude/

# Working docs (planning notes, eval reports, runbooks) are kept local only.
# The CI eval gate reads packages/evaluation/ranking/baseline.json (tracked), not docs/.
Document/